{
  "name": "apply_dedupe",
  "description": "apply-profile: the same revision and routing mode is a no-op (applied=false, no event); a new revision applies; switching routing_mode without a new revision applies; an invalid profile leaves the applied one in place. A default_node_id that no longer exists is accepted on apply (the current selection is kept).",
